# 10x-cli writes toolkit files with LF and hashes them against .10x-cli-manifest.json.
# With core.autocrlf=true, a CRLF working-tree copy hash-mismatches the manifest and
# `10x get` falsely reports "conflict_skipped", silently skipping real updates.
# Force LF on checkout for everything the CLI manages so future lesson fetches are clean.
.claude/** text eol=lf
